  "components": [
    {
      "name": "Button primary",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "Variante existente de acción en Claves API.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-button-primary\">Generar clave</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-primary{display:inline-flex;min-height:2.75rem;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:0.5rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.25rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 150ms,border-color 150ms,color 150ms;font-family:var(--font-sans, 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif);border:0;background:var(--theme-primary, oklch(68.1% 0.162 75.834));color:var(--theme-on-primary, oklch(21% 0.006 285.885));}.ds-button-primary:hover:not(:disabled){background:color-mix(in oklab, var(--theme-primary, oklch(68.1% 0.162 75.834)) 90%, transparent);}.ds-button-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--theme-primary, oklch(68.1% 0.162 75.834));outline-offset:2px;}.ds-button-primary:disabled{opacity:0.6;cursor:not-allowed;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Button secondary",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-secondary",
      "description": "Variante existente de acción en Claves API.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-button-secondary\">Cancelar</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-secondary{display:inline-flex;min-height:2.75rem;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:0.5rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.25rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 150ms,border-color 150ms,color 150ms;font-family:var(--font-sans, 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif);background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--theme-surface-border, oklch(32% 0.01 285));color:var(--theme-text-main, oklch(96% 0.003 285));}.ds-button-secondary:hover:not(:disabled){background:color-mix(in oklab, var(--theme-surface-border, oklch(32% 0.01 285)) 60%, transparent);}.ds-button-secondary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--theme-primary, oklch(68.1% 0.162 75.834));outline-offset:2px;}.ds-button-secondary:disabled{opacity:0.6;cursor:not-allowed;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Button danger",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-danger",
      "description": "Variante existente de acción en Claves API.",
      "html": "<button type=\"button\" class=\"ds-button-danger\">Sí, revocar</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-danger{display:inline-flex;min-height:2.75rem;align-items:center;justify-content:center;border-radius:0.5rem;padding:0.5rem 1rem;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.25rem;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 150ms,border-color 150ms,color 150ms;font-family:var(--font-sans, 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif);background:transparent;border:1px solid var(--theme-danger, oklch(65% 0.20 25));color:color-mix(in oklch, var(--theme-danger, oklch(65% 0.20 25)) 90%, var(--theme-text-main, oklch(96% 0.003 285)));}.ds-button-danger:hover:not(:disabled){background:color-mix(in oklab, var(--theme-danger, oklch(65% 0.20 25)) 10%, transparent);}.ds-button-danger:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--theme-primary, oklch(68.1% 0.162 75.834));outline-offset:2px;}.ds-button-danger:disabled{opacity:0.6;cursor:not-allowed;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Text field",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "field",
      "description": "Campo nativo con borde semántico y foco visible.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-field-label\" for=\"ds-name\">Nombre</label><input class=\"ds-field\" id=\"ds-name\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Ej. Asistente de mi proyecto\">",
      "css": ".ds-field-label{display:block;margin-bottom:0.5rem;color:var(--theme-text-main, oklch(96% 0.003 285));font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:500;font-family:var(--font-sans, 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif);}.ds-field{display:block;width:100%;min-width:0;min-height:2.75rem;border-radius:0.5rem;border:1px solid var(--theme-surface-border, oklch(32% 0.01 285));background:var(--theme-background, oklch(21% 0.006 285.885));padding:0.5rem 0.75rem;color:var(--theme-text-main, oklch(96% 0.003 285));font-size:1rem;caret-color:var(--theme-primary, oklch(68.1% 0.162 75.834));font-family:var(--font-sans, 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif);}.ds-field::placeholder{color:var(--theme-text-muted, oklch(72% 0.01 285))}.ds-field:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--theme-primary, oklch(68.1% 0.162 75.834));outline-offset:2px;}.ds-field::selection{background:var(--theme-primary, oklch(68.1% 0.162 75.834));color:var(--theme-on-primary, oklch(21% 0.006 285.885));}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Theme selector",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "field",
      "description": "Selector nativo de Tema en Configuración; el ejemplo es visual, sin persistencia.",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-select-label\" for=\"ds-theme\">Tema</label><select class=\"ds-select\" id=\"ds-theme\"><option>Ámbar</option><option>Océano</option><option>Bosque</option><option>Violeta</option></select>",
      "css": ".ds-select-label{display:block;margin-bottom:0.5rem;color:var(--theme-text-main, oklch(96% 0.003 285));font-size:0.875rem;font-weight:500;font-family:var(--font-sans, 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif);}.ds-select{display:block;width:100%;min-width:0;min-height:2.75rem;border-radius:0.5rem;border:1px solid var(--theme-surface-border, oklch(32% 0.01 285));background:var(--theme-background, oklch(21% 0.006 285.885));padding:0.5rem 0.75rem;color:var(--theme-text-main, oklch(96% 0.003 285));font-size:1rem;caret-color:var(--theme-primary, oklch(68.1% 0.162 75.834));font-family:var(--font-sans, 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif);cursor:pointer;}.ds-select:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--theme-primary, oklch(68.1% 0.162 75.834));outline-offset:2px;}.ds-select option{background:var(--theme-background, oklch(21% 0.006 285.885));color:var(--theme-text-main, oklch(96% 0.003 285));}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Settings navigation",
      "kind": "nav",
      "refersTo": "navigation-active",
      "description": "Entrada activa de Configuración en el pie de la barra lateral.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-nav\" href=\"/configuracion\" aria-current=\"page\">Configuración</a>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;align-items:center;min-height:2.75rem;padding:0.625rem 0.875rem;border:1px solid transparent;border-radius:0.75rem;background:var(--theme-primary, oklch(68.1% 0.162 75.834));color:var(--theme-on-primary, oklch(21% 0.006 285.885));font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.25rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;transition:color 150ms,background-color 150ms;font-family:var(--font-sans, 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif);}.ds-nav:hover{background:color-mix(in oklab, var(--theme-primary, oklch(68.1% 0.162 75.834)) 90%, transparent);}.ds-nav:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--theme-primary, oklch(68.1% 0.162 75.834));outline-offset:2px;}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Completed status",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "status-chip",
      "description": "Estado Terminado, con etiqueta y roles funcionales de éxito.",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-chip\">Terminado</span>",
      "css": ".ds-chip{display:inline-flex;padding:0.125rem 0.625rem;border:1px solid color-mix(in oklab, var(--theme-success, oklch(72% 0.17 142)) 30%, transparent);border-radius:0.5rem;background:color-mix(in oklab, var(--theme-success, oklch(72% 0.17 142)) 15%, transparent);color:var(--theme-success, oklch(72% 0.17 142));font-size:0.75rem;line-height:1rem;font-weight:500;font-family:var(--font-sans, 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif);}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Settings surface",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "settings-card",
      "description": "Superficie sin sombra usada para agrupar controles.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-card\"><h2 class=\"ds-card-title\">Apariencia</h2><p class=\"ds-card-copy\">Elige cómo se ve Cassandra.</p></section>",
      "css": ".ds-card{border:1px solid var(--theme-surface-border, oklch(32% 0.01 285));border-radius:1rem;background:var(--theme-surface, oklch(26% 0.008 285));color:var(--theme-text-main, oklch(96% 0.003 285));padding:1.25rem;font-family:var(--font-sans, 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif);}.ds-card-title{margin:0;font-size:1.25rem;line-height:1.75rem;font-weight:600;}.ds-card-copy{margin:0.5rem 0 0;color:var(--theme-text-muted, oklch(72% 0.01 285));font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.25rem;}@media(min-width:48rem){.ds-card{padding:1.5rem;}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "API keys connection",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "connection-card",
      "description": "Entrada de Conexiones hacia Claves API. El texto y la flecha conservan la composición de la implementación.",
      "html": "<a class=\"ds-connection\" href=\"/configuracion/claves-api\"><span class=\"ds-connection-text\"><span class=\"ds-connection-title\">Claves API</span><span class=\"ds-connection-copy\">Conecta tus asistentes y administra sus permisos.</span></span><svg class=\"ds-connection-arrow\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"/><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"/></svg></a>",
      "css": ".ds-connection{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:1rem;min-height:5rem;padding:1.25rem;border:1px solid var(--theme-surface-border, oklch(32% 0.01 285));border-radius:1rem;background:var(--theme-surface, oklch(26% 0.008 285));color:var(--theme-text-main, oklch(96% 0.003 285));text-decoration:none;transition:background-color 150ms,color 150ms;font-family:var(--font-sans, 'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif);}.ds-connection-text{flex:1;min-width:0;}.ds-connection-title{display:block;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.5rem;font-weight:600;}.ds-connection-copy{display:block;margin-top:0.25rem;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.25rem;color:var(--theme-text-muted, oklch(72% 0.01 285));}.ds-connection-arrow{flex-shrink:0;color:var(--theme-text-muted, oklch(72% 0.01 285));}.ds-connection:hover{background:color-mix(in oklab, var(--theme-surface-border, oklch(32% 0.01 285)) 40%, transparent);}.ds-connection:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--theme-primary, oklch(68.1% 0.162 75.834));outline-offset:2px;}@media(min-width:48rem){.ds-connection{padding:1.5rem;}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Minimal cognitive load, high clarity, structured focus mode",
    "overview": "Cassandra conserva una interfaz de trabajo compacta y estructurada: fondos continuos, superficies delimitadas, tipografía legible y un acento reconocible para orientar la acción. La identidad vigente de PRODUCT.md exige claridad y poca distracción.\n\nLas cuatro paletas cambian los roles cromáticos y mantienen la misma jerarquía, geometría y navegación. Ámbar oscuro es la apariencia original y predeterminada; Océano, Bosque y Violeta amplían esa misma identidad. No se establece una nueva dirección artística.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Jerarquía mediante contraste tonal, bordes y peso tipográfico.",
      "Un rol primario estable por paleta; estados funcionales separados del tema.",
      "Controles con etiquetas visibles y foco explícito en Configuración.",
      "La misma estructura en las ocho combinaciones de paleta y modo resuelto."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "Semantic Roles",
        "body": "El componente elige un rol, no una paleta. Los valores y alias pertenecen a theme.css; styles.css expone los mismos roles a Tailwind.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "Paired Foregrounds",
        "body": "Un fondo sólido primario usa on-primary; un fondo accent o success usa su correspondiente on-accent u on-success. La elección de tema no cambia este contrato.",
        "section": "colors"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do usar los roles semánticos compartidos y sus pares de texto sobre color.",
      "Do conservar dimensiones, jerarquía, etiquetas y contenido al cambiar de tema.",
      "Do mantener el contorno de foco visible y las etiquetas nativas de los selectores.",
      "Do conservar la clave de apariencia por dispositivo y la aplicación previa al primer render."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't fijar texto blanco sobre el primario: el color correcto depende de on-primary.",
      "Don't convertir los colores de error, éxito o advertencia en variantes de marca.",
      "Don't crear otra tabla de colores dentro de un componente o duplicar los tokens de theme.css.",
      "Don't afirmar que las barras nativas Android siguen la paleta: conservan R.color.app_background."
    ]
  }
}
